@startuml
!theme plain
title Module-specific Guidance Processing (gw:gw-per-module)

actor "Maven" as Maven
participant "GWPerModuleMojo" as Mojo
participant "GuidanceProcessor" as Processor
participant "AI Engine" as AI

== For Each Module in Reactor Order ==

Maven -> Mojo: execute() for Module N
activate Mojo

Mojo -> Mojo: Initialize statistics
Mojo -> Mojo: Load configuration\n(serverId or config file)
Mojo -> Mojo: Apply parameters

Mojo -> Processor: Create processor\n(rooted at execution root)
activate Processor

Mojo -> Processor: Disable recursive\nmodule processing
note right: Prevents processor from\nscanning child modules

Mojo -> Mojo: Set scan path to\ncurrent module directory

alt Maven project exists
    Mojo -> Mojo: Register class\nintrospection tools
end

Mojo -> Processor: Scan for guidance\ncomments in module
Processor -> AI: Process each\nguidance instruction
AI --> Processor: Apply changes
Processor --> Mojo: Complete

Mojo -> Mojo: Log statistics
Mojo --> Maven: Module complete

deactivate Processor
deactivate Mojo

Maven -> Maven: Continue with\nnext module

@enduml